silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_concrete_anchor_2#mittenscolimitapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensColimitApex is The colimit apex whose incoming and outgoing profile sous reads via Y^in_Mittens and Y^out_Mittens. Sous reads the profile; it does not author new arrows into or out of Mittens. The profile is determined by what exists, not by what sous wishes existed." .
